      "vulnSlug": "other-ineffective-resource-bound",
      "title": "Sweep-cap test accepts a helper whose limit can be overridden",
      "description": "The test only requires limit: SWEEP_LIMIT to appear near the readPage declaration. The referenced helper currently constructs options as { limit: SWEEP_LIMIT, ...opts }, so a caller-provided limit, including undefined, overwrites the cap and can restore an unbounded collection read. The test therefore passes even though its assertion message claims every helper read is capped.",
